      "title": "Enforce revision-bound plan integrity before lane mutation",
      "class": "implementation",
      "objective": "Implement the versioned semantic plan contract, opt-in migration configuration, start-gate join, installation propagation, and focused controls.",
      "profile": "standard",
      "execution_class": "independently_executable",
      "claimability": "not_applicable",
      "scope": {
        "included": [
          "PlanIntegrityResultV1 and frontier parser",
          "Repository opt-in mode and adoption floor",
          "Coordinated and release plan-start admission before mutation",
          "Direct plan-bound claim admission against the exact Git start revision",
          "One full start-revision custody across readiness, claim, worktree creation, and session upsert",
          "Visible typed findings in observe mode",
          "Unambiguous governed-section and portable path parsing",
          "Worktree-only installed readiness dependency closure",
          "Ownership-aware start rollback for claims, branches, worktrees, and trackers",
          "Staged pre-worktree reservation and session activation semantics",
          "Legacy claim migration truthfulness",
          "Source and installed CLI parity",
          "Canonical installer configuration, plan, worktree, and advisory-config templates",
          "Documentation relationship linkage for the live contract",
          "Focused positive, negative, compatibility, and mutation-order tests",
